---
globs:
  - "artifacts/**/*.json"
  - "workflow/**/*.md"
alwaysApply: true
---

An approval is valid only for the exact content hash, selected variant, asset IDs, Page ID, and any per-post quality override shown to the reviewer. The chat draft must be materialized into the local review profile before the preview is opened. Any edit creates a new version and invalidates approval. AI may prepare `NEEDS_HUMAN_APPROVAL`; only the local review server (`backend/approval/local-review-server.mjs`) signing `approval.json` with `APPROVAL_SIGNING_KEY` may create `APPROVED`. The decision is always a button click on the local review page opened by `npm run review:open -- <post_job_id>`; a chat message, an `AskQuestion` selection, or silence is never a decision. The agent must never write or edit `approval.json` by hand, never infer approval, and never choose "Duyệt và đăng" for the reviewer.
